      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.67",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.67"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "68",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:68"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "68",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi ku bakulu ab'enda dha baiseibwe bwe baatuuka e Yerusalemu aghaabanga eisinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda, baaghaayo ebigheebwayo eby'ekyeyendere olw'endhu ya Katonda eyo ezimbibwe mu kifo kyayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.68",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.68"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "69",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:69"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "69",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli muntu yaaghaayo ebintu ebyakolanga omulimo ogwo nga bwe yasobola: kilo ebikumi bitaanu (500) edha zaabu, ni kilo enkumi ibiri na lunaana (2,800) edha feeza, n'ebivaalo bya bakabona kikumi (100).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.69",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.69"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
