            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.11.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 11:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Agho bakabona, n'Abalevi, n'abembi, n'abakuumi b'emiryango gy'eisinzizo, n'abagheereza b'omu isinzizo, n'abantu abandi, baasenga mu Yerusalemu n'ebiketezo ebikiriiraine. N'Abaisiraeli abandi boonaboona baaja baasenga mu bibuga ebyalingamu badhaadha baibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.70",
